          "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14",
          "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> and <MATH_0002> be sites. Let\n<MATH_0003> be continuous.\nAssume furthermore the following:\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003> the category <MATH_0004> has a final object <MATH_0005> and\n<MATH_0006> is a final object of <MATH_0007> , and\n<STRUCT_0004> the category <MATH_0008> has fibre products and\n<MATH_0009> commutes with them.\n<STRUCT_0005>\nThen <MATH_0010> defines a morphism of sites <MATH_0011>, in other words <MATH_0012> is exact.\n<STRUCT_0006>",
